      "footnotes": [
        "Detention fee as provided for in Rules 30 tnd 57. Withdrawal fee as provided for in Rule 31.",
        "Sailing vessels, steamers or motor vessels not under their own power, and sailing vessels powered by auxiliary engines, are charged 25% more than the steamer rates. Tonnage charges to remain the same.",
