        "In the case of men-of-war the tonnage charge is leviable on the displacement—three tons of displacement to count as one ton for tariff purpose.",
        "Note:—Except as regards Withdrawal and Detention fees, the above tariff is reduced by 15% as from 1st July, 1925."
